{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おばんです〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はみなみちゃんのお誕生日でした!!\nみなみちゃんお誕生日おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/07/4350557/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/07/4350557/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/07/4350557/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/07/4350557/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/07/4350557/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/07/4350557/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/07/4350557/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/07/4350557/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/07/4350557/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみちゃんのその自由な感じかいいね〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ\nいつもかわいいな〜って癒されてます♪\n高校生になるのね〜凄く現代っ子のみなみちゃんはどんな高校生になるのかしら？\n楽しみですね〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お茶おいしい。\n炭酸もいいけどもお茶うまいね。抹茶入りお茶が一番うまいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね。\nじゃがいものスライスしたやつをあげたやつがうまいね。うますぎるよ。甘い黒い炭酸とのコラボレーションがいいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近あんまりケーキとかクレープとか苦手になってきてしまった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はおう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おっスカイツリーライトアップされてる!!\nどこからでも見れるのってすごいね〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばスカイツリーにジャンプショップあるよね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行かなくちゃ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/07/4350557/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、最近深夜アニメがいこまの癒しです♪\n毎週録画してね、朝見てたりするのよね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんも深夜アニメをいっぱい見ましょうね〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞いてくれてありがとう!!\nへばなっ!!"}],"source":"archive"}